Z||000000||FieroLisa||04-20-2001||09:45 AM||||Alright so I'm about to head off to class and the forum is boring right now, so I'd just like to say how much I hate Ohio. It was snowing a couple weeks ago, then it was 80 degrees then it was snowing not a week later and now its pouring down rain. And dangit I just did my hair and its gonna get all messed up going to class.... whew, thank god I can work on my car inside later!<P>Oh and also, all this boredom has led me to start being an ebay junkie, so I better find something to drag me away from my computer!!<P><P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT- 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air,<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||ChadMan||04-20-2001||10:25 AM||||There are many things I like about Ohio, but our weather does bite the root.  It rains every 36 hours in this Godforsaken town.  <P>My father-in-law in Phoenix washes his Fiero and it stays clean for two months.  I wash mine and I'm lucky if it stays clean for two days.||||reg||9
Z||000002||Wade87GT||04-20-2001||10:38 AM||||But you've got Mid-Ohio! I love that track! But, check out my local playground by clicking the "Tour Destin" button.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.destinchamber.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.destinchamber.com/</A> <P>Then come on down.<P>Wade<P>||||reg||14
