Z||000004||Shaun41178||04-20-2001||10:55 AM||||Ahh sunny daytona Beach.  AHHH<P>hasn't rained here for all of april.  Sunny and 75-90 every day.<P>Oh yea did I mention it was sunny and warm?  Sorry lisa had to do it.  Partially cause I use to live there and know what it is like.  I feel bad for your hair.<P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
