Z||000006||Eric||04-20-2001||11:22 AM||||The weather may suck, but everything's so green and lush right now.  Shaun, are you telling us you wouldn't rather be in Toledo right now.  You could be singing songs with the birds and skipping through fields of wildflowers.  You could be picking dandilions on the street corner while the neighbor kids call you fruity and throw rocks at you from their mopeds.  Ahhh...  Good times.<p>[This message has been edited by Eric (edited 04-20-2001).]||||reg||1
